WEBVTT

00:06:28.095 --> 00:06:33.755
And do these women talk to each other at any point in the movie?

00:06:33.755 --> 00:06:37.208
And is their conversation about something other than

00:06:37.208 --> 00:06:40.524
the guy that they both like? (Laughter)

00:06:40.524 --> 00:06:44.856
Right? Thank you. (Applause)

00:06:44.856 --> 00:06:46.681
Thank you very much.

00:06:46.681 --> 00:06:54.284
Two women who exist and talk to each other about stuff.

00:06:54.284 --> 00:06:59.414
It does happen. I've seen it,

00:06:59.414 --> 00:07:02.362
and yet I very rarely see it in the movies